    "en": [
      "6? - Free for children under 12.\nOrganized by Avenir Croisien.\n\"Claude, François et les autres\", comedy in 4 acts by Guy Molay and \"Case créole\", comedy in 3 acts by Patrick Porrez.\nDoors open at 8pm."
    ],
    "it": [
